   - **Severity:** High
   - **Affected Code Location:** `readMarble` function (line 120)
   - **Description:** The `readMarble` function allows any user to read the private details of a marble. This can lead to private data leakage.
   - **Recommended Fix:** Restrict access to private data to only authorized users.
